:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDSBM'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDSBM HELP=HLPCMDSBM KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Submit Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?SBMCODEJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SBMCRQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SBMDBJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SBMDKTJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?SBMFNCJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SBMJOB'.Submit Job  SBMJOB
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?SBMNETJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?SBMNWSCMD'.
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?SBMRJEJOB'.
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?SBMRMTCMD'.
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDSBM.Submit Commands - Help
:P.Submit Commands: every command whose name starts with SBM, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full IBM i command set, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
